# Changelog

All notable changes to FancyUI. This project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/).

---

## v0.4.1

### Patch Changes

- Fix `manualstart` prop renamed to `manualStart` in Confetti
- Add FluidCursorAdvanced for contained canvas with interaction & autonomous animation props (`interactive`, `autoSplat`, `autoSplatInterval`, `pauseWhenHidden`, `splatOnMount`)
- Add `fluidColor`, `fluidColors`, `colorIntensity` props and hex `backColor` support to FluidCursor
- Add Vercel Analytics
- New landing page design

## v0.4.0

### Minor Changes

- Add **MatrixRain** — canvas-based Matrix-style falling glyph rain
- Add **TerminalText** — terminal-style text streamer with per-character animation, blinking cursor, and glitch effect
- Add **Component Copilot** — AI chat demo at `/demo/component-copilot`

## v0.3.0

### Minor Changes

- Add **DisplacementText** — 3D text with WebGL displacement using Three.js shaders
- Add **PropsPlayground** — interactive props editor for demo pages

### Patch Changes

- Add **AppleCardCarousel** — horizontal card carousel with spring-animated full-screen expansion
- Add **LineHoverLink** — link with 11 animated underline hover effects, pure CSS
- Add npm package build pipeline (`npm install fancy-ui`)
- Fix Compare corner overflow and broken AnimatedTooltip image
- Fix FlipWords layout shift during word transition

## v0.2.1

### Patch Changes

- Republish with correct package name `fancy-ui-svelte`
- Separate package build step from changeset publish

## v0.2.0

### Minor Changes

- Add **AnimatedTestimonials** — testimonial carousel with smooth slide animations and optional autoplay
- Set up changesets versioning workflow

## v0.1.0 — 2026-03-13

Initial public release — 50 components across 10 categories, built with Svelte 5 runes and Tailwind CSS v4.

### Buttons (5)

RainbowButton, ShimmerButton, RippleButton, GradientButton, InteractiveHoverButton

### Cards (8)

BentoGrid, Book, Card3D, CardSpotlight, DirectionAwareHover, FlipCard, GlareCard, TextRevealCard

### Text & Typography (12)

BlurReveal, BoxReveal, ColourfulText, ContainerTextFlip, FlipWords, Focus, HyperText, LetterPullup, LineShadowText, NumberTicker, SparklesText, TextGenerateEffect

### Backgrounds (4)

FallingStarsBg, FlickeringGrid, Sparkles, StarsBackground

### Effects (14)

AnimatedBeam, BorderBeam, Confetti, FluidCursor, GlowBorder, GlowingEffect, ImageTrailCursor, InteractiveGridPattern, LiquidGlass, Meteors, NeonBorder, Ripple, SmoothCursor, TracingBeam

### Layout (2)

ContainerScroll, Marquee

### Navigation (3)

Dock, Timeline, LogoCloud

### Data Display (1)

AnimatedTooltip

### Media (1)

Compare
